=== WHAT IT MEANS FOR R2 (the prior centre) ===
  prior today   N(0, 1.00 ppm)  -> the fitted +4.220 sits at z +4.22
  re-centred    N(+0.74, 1.00) -> the SAME fitted value sits at z +3.48
  ⇒ re-centring on the measured offset RELIEVES 18 % of the strain and leaves +3.48 sd.
  ⚠ Unexplained residue: +3.48 ppm = 82 % of the fitted offset. Re-centring
     RELABELS that residue, it does not remove it.
  ⚠ A representation term's defensible sd FLOOR is ~0.20 ppm (Francey et al. 2019,
     ACP 19:14741, inter-network spread on a station DIFFERENCE) -- 5x tighter than
     today's prior. At that width the same fitted value sits at z +17.4.
  ⛔ AND IT CANNOT BE DECIDED ON CO2 ALONE: rep_dC is tied across species by mass
     balance, and >1/3 of its 1306.9 log-units is ISOTOPIC (09-22 (n) Appendix A1).
